<section class="lumen-section lumen-section--yellow">
  <div class="lumen-container lumen-container--narrow">
    <div class="lumen-prose">
      <h2>Standard.</h2>
      <p>WCAG 2.2 Level AA conformance. Every change shipped to lumenelectric.example passes both an automated audit and a manual screen-reader pass before deploy.</p>

      <h2>What we've done on the site.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Black + electric-yellow palette tested for AA contrast at every state. The yellow-on-black combination clears 16:1; black-on-yellow clears the same. Outline buttons hit 7:1 minimum.</li>
        <li>Every interactive element keyboard-reachable with a visible 3px focus indicator.</li>
        <li>Heading hierarchy is semantic (h1 &rarr; h2 &rarr; h3 in order, no skipped levels).</li>
        <li>Mobile nav opens on the right with a 44&times;44 close button and traps focus while open.</li>
        <li>The bold uppercase Archivo Black display type is reserved for headings, body copy stays in Archivo at 1rem with 1.55 line-height for comfortable reading.</li>
        <li>Site honors <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>. The diagonal yellow accent shape on the home page hides at narrow viewports and never animates.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="lumen-section">
  <div class="lumen-container lumen-container--narrow">
    <div class="lumen-prose">
      <h2>On the job.</h2>
      <p>If you'd like accommodation during the site visit or install, sign-language interpretation (we work with a local agency, 48 hr lead time), large-print printed materials, written job summaries instead of verbal walk-through, tell us when you book.</p>

      <h2>Shop access.</h2>
      <p>Our Linden Street shop has a level entrance with a 36" door. Counter is at standard height. There's no dedicated ADA parking on the block but Linden Street has wide curb-cuts at every corner. Call before visiting if anything would help.</p>

      <h2>Tell us when we miss.</h2>
      <p>If anything on this site is inaccessible to you, please tell us. Email <a href="mailto:shop@lumenelectric.example">shop@lumenelectric.example</a> with subject "Accessibility" or call <a href="tel:9283159094">(928) 315-9094</a> and ask for Vivian.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
